				copyright: "Bulgakov Handbook. Copyright 1999-2008 Archpriest Eugene D. Tarris.",
				text: "<p>He suffered in Rome about 283-284. Refusing to bring a sacrifice to idols and subverting the latter by the power of prayer, St. Marinus after severe torture was beheaded by the sword. </p>",
